WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.410
Some volcanoes occur inside plates, away from plate boundaries. Rising hot

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:08.471
mantle can partially melt at shallow depth and feed a hot

00:00:08.471 --> 00:00:08.840
spot.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.010
The plate carries each volcano away from the active center. A

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:19.669
new volcano grows over the same hot spot. The chain gets

00:00:19.669 --> 00:00:21.000
older away from activity.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:28.763
Remember his examples: Hawaii in the ocean, and Yellowstone on a

00:00:28.763 --> 00:00:29.164
continent.
